<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Marie Curie</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Marie Curie</h1>
<p>Physicist and chemist, Paris, France.</p>
<h2>Awards</h2>
<ul><li>Nobel Prize in Physics, 1903</li><li>Nobel Prize in Chemistry, 1911</li></ul>
</body></html>

